  "definition": {
    "schema_version": 1,
    "meta": {
      "verified": false,
      "source_doc": "Audited financial statements (as understood in v1; to verify)",
      "auditor_fields": [
        "auditor.auditor_name",
        "auditor.auditor_firm",
        "auditor.auditor_cpa_no",
        "auditor.auditor_accreditation_no",
        "auditor.accreditation_valid_until",
        "auditor.audit_date",
        "auditor.audit_opinion",
        "auditor.audit_report_date"
      ],
      "notes": "2026.2 (2026-11-12): Adds the statement of operations, changes in equity and cash flows beside the balance sheet, five supporting documents, the auditor's firm, CPA number, accreditation validity, audit date and remarks, the auditor fields the Audited stage needs (meta.auditor_fields) and the savings GL check. Still to verify against the official CDA form."
